  Every user-visible string in the app lives here, once, in English.
  Each translation in values-<language>/strings.xml carries the same
  keys. Keep format specifiers (%1$s, %1$d) exactly as they are here:
  their order may change in a translation, their set may not.
  Debug logs are deliberately NOT localized: they are diagnostic
  files, read by developers, and stay English in every language.
-->
